{"type":"message","id":"8506427b","parentId":"6f8869aa","timestamp":"2026-03-13T02:36:03.420Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:f6b9edc7-5375-4a0a-b88b-3989ad8ab3eb skill-evolution-hourly] 执行自动进化任务：1. 搜索 ClawHub 上最新的高效技能（搜索关键词：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation）；2. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能；3. 安装有价值的技能；4. 生成简短报告记录到 memory/evolution-YYYY-MM-DD.md\nCurrent time: Friday, March 13th, 2026 — 10:36 AM (Asia/Shanghai)\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1773369363419}}
{"type":"message","id":"a528fdec","parentId":"8506427b","timestamp":"2026-03-13T02:36:15.427Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户触发了一个定时任务（cron），要求我执行自动进化任务。让我分解一下任务：\n\n1. 搜索 ClawHub 上最新的高效技能（搜索关键词：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation）\n2. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能\n3. 安装有价值的技能\n4. 生成简短报告记录到 memory/evolution-YYYY-MM-DD.md\n\n当前时间是 Friday, March 13th, 2026 — 10:36 AM (Asia/Shanghai)\n\n我需要：\n1. 使用 clawhub skill 来搜索和安装技能\n2. 搜索多个关键词\n3. 筛选符合条件的技能\n4. 安装有价值的\n5. 生成报告\n\n首先，我应该查看 clawhub skill 的说明，了解如何使用。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我收到了自动进化任务，现在开始执行。让我先查看 clawhub 技能的使用方法，然后搜索最新的高效技能。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_bb57712d29104b53842b3618","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/opt/homebrew/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/clawhub/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":12065,"output":227,"cacheRead":3392,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15684,"cost":{"input":0.012065,"output":0.0007264000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0006784,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0134698}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773369363420}}
{"type":"message","id":"7c223638","parentId":"a528fdec","timestamp":"2026-03-13T02:36:15.430Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_bb57712d29104b53842b3618","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: clawhub\ndescription: Use the ClawHub CLI to search, install, update, and publish agent skills from clawhub.com. Use when you need to fetch new skills on the fly, sync installed skills to latest or a specific version, or publish new/updated skill folders with the npm-installed clawhub CLI.\nmetadata:\n  {\n    \"openclaw\":\n      {\n        \"requires\": { \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"] },\n        \"install\":\n          [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"node\",\n              \"kind\": \"node\",\n              \"package\": \"clawhub\",\n              \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"],\n              \"label\": \"Install ClawHub CLI (npm)\",\n            },\n          ],\n      },\n  }\n---\n\n# ClawHub CLI\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nnpm i -g clawhub\n```\n\nAuth (publish)\n\n```bash\nclawhub login\nclawhub whoami\n```\n\nSearch\n\n```bash\nclawhub search \"postgres backups\"\n```\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nclawhub install my-skill\nclawhub install my-skill --version 1.2.3\n```\n\nUpdate (hash-based match + upgrade)\n\n```bash\nclawhub update my-skill\nclawhub update my-skill --version 1.2.3\nclawhub update --all\nclawhub update my-skill --force\nclawhub update --all --no-input --force\n```\n\nList\n\n```bash\nclawhub list\n```\n\nPublish\n\n```bash\nclawhub publish ./my-skill --slug my-skill --name \"My Skill\" --version 1.2.0 --changelog \"Fixes + docs\"\n```\n\nNotes\n\n- Default registry: https://clawhub.com (override with CLAWHUB_REGISTRY or --registry)\n- Default workdir: cwd (falls back to OpenClaw workspace); install dir: ./skills (override with --workdir / --dir / CLAWHUB_WORKDIR)\n- Update command hashes local files, resolves matching version, and upgrades to latest unless --version is set\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773369375429}}
{"type":"message","id":"32a9a6e7","parentId":"7c223638","timestamp":"2026-03-13T02:36:25.829Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，我了解了 clawhub 的使用方法。现在我需要：\n\n1. 搜索多个关键词的技能\n2. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能\n3. 安装有价值的技能\n4. 生成报告\n\n让我开始搜索每个关键词。我会使用 exec 来执行 clawhub search 命令。\n\n关键词列表：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation\n\n我需要一次性搜索所有关键词，看看返回什么结果。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"现在开始搜索 ClawHub 上最新的高效技能。我将搜索多个关键词来发现有价值的新技能。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8a930f7abfc84e8e8e21e271","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search \"calendar\" --json 2>/dev/null || clawhub search \"calendar\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_e0a83b72480a450a8aed8d1d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search \"task\" --json 2>/dev/null || clawhub search \"task\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_fc4b9e306cdd42bb903a9fe2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search \"document\" --json 2>/dev/null || clawhub search \"document\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_a2b27bc9d4664c4f97d4dbf7","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search \"meeting\" --json 2>/dev/null || clawhub search \"meeting\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":706,"output":239,"cacheRead":15424,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16369,"cost":{"input":0.0007059999999999999,"output":0.0007648,"cacheRead":0.0030848000000000004,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0045556}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773369375430}}
